"P1933772938" "There is a 87% probability that you are highly disoriented due to your recent experience. It is also 92% likely that you have hostile intentions toward me as well as everything within a 7 kilometer radius of this installation.<br><br>If you could but put those emotions aside for a moment then I'm sure you would like to hear what my superior offers. Allow me a moment to access the message."

