"P2778031155" "Doctor Leta"
// DetailString :
"P2334282034" "The android, IVy, has been programmed to send primal earthlings to one Doctor Leta, a research scientist holed up in Facility B here in Enclosure 17."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4008610039" "Welcome, primal earthling. I am IVy, the receptionist here at Enclosure 17. I have been reprogrammed to direct primals to Doctor Leta in order to take full advantage of the ongoing situation. Please consider her offer."
// AcceptString :
"P1863690332" "Talk to Doctor Leta."
// SendOffString :
"P2926454819" "Hurray!<br><br>...<br><br>I apologize for my outburst, but my emotional coding is still being debugged. As you can see, the Enclosure is in a state of distress. The clockwork security forces have gone to maximum alert and they currently threaten Doctor Leta and her research staff. You can find them at Facility B.<br><br>...<br><br>Enjoy your stay here at Enclosure 17.<br><br>Bubye!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3120928960" "Talk to Dr. Leta."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2294878078" "I'm afraid that I have no further sub-routines regarding you. Please speak with Doctor Leta."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P184346466" "IVy has given you a clue."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1410964962" "Ah, {HeroName}. I knew the moment I read your file that you would not only escape, but be willing to take advantage of this situation."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1307158241" "I am Doctor Leta, one of the senior staff members of this, until recently, fully functional rift research enclosure. No doubt you could care less about what problems my staff and I face at this juncture, except that our fates are now, unfortunately, intertwined.<br><br>But do not fret, for I have a plan for which you are perfectly suited."
